00:07:16.135 --> 00:07:17.136
SYSTEM, WHICH REQUIRES CUSTOMERS

00:07:17.203 --> 00:07:17.804
TO OPT IN TO VOTER REGISTRATION.

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:18.638
SECRETARY OF STATE DATA

00:07:18.704 --> 00:07:20.439
INDICATES THAT EACH YEAR, 1

00:07:20.506 --> 00:07:21.374
MILLION ELIGIBLE UNREGISTERED

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:23.743
PEOPLE CONDUCT A LICENSE

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:24.877
