00:07:24.944 --> 00:07:26.679
NOT REGISTER TO VOTE. SB 299

00:07:26.746 --> 00:07:28.548
GIVES THE SECRETARY OF STATE A

00:07:28.614 --> 00:07:30.049
POWERFUL TOOL TO ADDRESS THIS

00:07:30.116 --> 00:07:31.884
