00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:39.792
REGISTRATION AS A SUPPLEMENT TO

00:07:39.859 --> 00:07:40.960
THE CURRENT MOTOR VOTER PROCESS.

00:07:41.027 --> 00:07:42.628
THE DMV WOULD TRANSMIT

00:07:42.695 --> 00:07:43.663
INFORMATION TO THE SECRETARY OF

00:07:43.729 --> 00:07:45.665
