00:07:47.834 --> 00:07:49.535
BUT WHO HAVE PROVIDED A U.S.

00:07:49.602 --> 00:07:50.603
PASSPORT OR ANOTHER DOCUMENT

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:51.637
CONCLUSIVELY SHOWING U.S.

00:07:51.704 --> 00:07:52.738
CITIZENSHIP AS PART OF THEIR

00:07:52.805 --> 00:07:53.573
