00:08:03.516 --> 00:08:05.551
SAVE PEOPLE SUBSTANTIAL TIME AND

00:08:05.618 --> 00:08:07.253
EFFORT OF RESUPPLYING ALL OF THE

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:08.221
INFORMATION ALREADY PROVIDED

00:08:08.287 --> 00:08:10.823
DURING A DMV TRANSACTION, MAKING

00:08:10.890 --> 00:08:11.324
REGISTRATION AND VOTING

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:14.327
SIGNIFICANTLY EASIER. THIS SAME

00:08:14.393 --> 00:08:15.494
