00:08:29.542 --> 00:08:30.576
VOTER PROCESS. FIRST, PEOPLE WHO

00:08:30.643 --> 00:08:32.411
PROVIDE A GREEN CARD OR OTHER

00:08:32.478 --> 00:08:32.879
DOCUMENT CONCLUSIVELY

00:08:32.945 --> 00:08:33.579
ESTABLISHING NON-CITIZENSHIP

00:08:33.646 --> 00:08:35.681
DURING THEIR DMV TRANSACTION

00:08:35.748 --> 00:08:36.816
WILL BE AUTOMATICALLY FILTERED

00:08:36.883 --> 00:08:38.517
OUT OF THE CURRENT MOTOR VOTER

00:08:38.584 --> 00:08:39.552
PROCESS. THIS SIGNIFICANTLY

00:08:39.619 --> 00:08:41.554
REDUCES THE RISK OF A MISTAKEN

00:08:41.621 --> 00:08:42.622
