00:08:42.688 --> 00:08:44.390
AND REMOVES A TRAP FOR THE

00:08:44.457 --> 00:08:45.558
UNWARY IN THE CURRENT PROCESS.

00:08:45.625 --> 00:08:48.227
SECOND, SB 299 REQUIRES THE DMV

00:08:48.294 --> 00:08:49.462
TO WORK WITH THE SECRETARY OF

00:08:49.528 --> 00:08:50.496
STATE TO AUTOMATICALLY CHECK

00:08:50.563 --> 00:08:51.564
